<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Location Power Differential Mapping | Strategy Command Center</title>

<style>
:root{
    --bg:#1C2419;
    --accent:#D8B4E2;
    --text:#F4F1DE;
    --border:#3A4735;

    --surface:#232D20;
    --surface2:#293526;
    --muted:#B8B8A6;
    --success:#A8D5BA;
    --warning:#E8C98B;
    --danger:#D99090;

    --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    font-family:
        Inter,
        ui-sans-serif,
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.7;
}

button,
input,
select,
textarea{
    font:inherit;
}

button{
    cursor:pointer;
}

button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible,
select:focus-visible,
textarea:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset:3px;
}

/* =========================
   TOP PROGRESS
========================= */

#scrollProgress{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;
    left:0;
    height:4px;
    width:0%;
    background:var(--accent);
    z-index:9999;
}

/* =========================
   NAV
========================= */

.nav{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:1000;
    background:rgba(28,36,25,.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.nav-inner{
    max-width:1250px;
    margin:auto;
    min-height:64px;
    padding:10px 20px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
}

.brand{
    color:var(--text);
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.8rem;
}

.nav-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.nav-btn,
.btn{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--surface);
    color:var(--text);
    padding:9px 14px;
    border-radius:9px;
    transition:.2s ease;
}

.nav-btn:hover,
.btn:hover{
    border-color:var(--accent);
    color:var(--accent);
    transform:translateY(-1px);
}

.btn.primary{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:#241B27;
    border-color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:800;
}

.btn.primary:hover{
    background:#E7C9EF;
    color:#241B27;
}

/* =========================
   HERO
========================= */

.hero{
    min-height:650px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    padding:80px 20px 70px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,rgba(216,180,226,.13),transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%,rgba(168,213,186,.08),transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#1C2419,#202A1D 55%,#171D16);
}

.hero-grid{
    width:100%;
    max-width:1250px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
    gap:60px;
    align-items:center;
}

.eyebrow{
    color:var(--accent);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
    font-size:.75rem;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:18px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.8rem);
    line-height:.98;
    max-width:850px;
    letter-spacing:-.055em;
}

.hero h1 span{
    color:var(--accent);
}

.hero-copy{
    max-width:760px;
    color:#D7D5C6;
    font-size:1.08rem;
    margin-top:25px;
}

.hero-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:12px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:30px;
}

/* =========================
   PLAYER CARD
========================= */

.player-card{
    background:rgba(35,45,32,.9);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:26px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.player-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-bottom:22px;
}

.rank{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    font-size:.8rem;
}

.xp-number{
    font-size:2rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

.xp-label{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.75rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.xp-track{
    height:10px;
    background:#11170F;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    margin:10px 0 20px;
}

.xp-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#A8D5BA);
    transition:.5s ease;
}

.stat-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:10px;
}

.stat{
    padding:15px;
    background:var(--surface2);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
}

.stat small{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.65rem;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
}

.stat strong{
    display:block;
    margin-top:3px;
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:1.15rem;
}

/* =========================
   MAIN
========================= */

.container{
    width:min(1250px,calc(100% - 40px));
    margin:auto;
}

section{
    padding:85px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.section-head{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:end;
    gap:25px;
    margin-bottom:35px;
}

.section-number{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
}

h2{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.3rem);
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-.035em;
    margin-top:8px;
}

.section-intro{
    max-width:760px;
    color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   INSIGHT CARDS
========================= */

.insight-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:18px;
}

.insight-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:28px;
    border-radius:18px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:.25s ease;
}

.insight-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
    border-color:var(--accent);
}

.insight-card .number{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.15em;
}

.insight-card h3{
    margin:13px 0 10px;
    font-size:1.25rem;
}

.insight-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
}

.reveal{
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    opacity:0;
    transition:.35s ease;
}

.insight-card.open .reveal{
    max-height:300px;
    opacity:1;
    margin-top:18px;
}

.reveal-btn{
    margin-top:18px;
    background:none;
    color:var(--accent);
    border:0;
    font-weight:800;
    padding:0;
}

/* =========================
   LOCATION LAB
========================= */

.lab{
    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(216,180,226,.08),transparent 40%),
        var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:30px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.lab-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:30px;
}

.form-group{
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.form-group label{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    font-size:.82rem;
    font-weight:800;
}

.value-display{
    color:var(--accent);
}

input[type="text"],
input[type="number"],
select,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    background:#161D14;
    color:var(--text);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:13px 14px;
}

input[type="range"]{
    width:100%;
    accent-color:var(--accent);
}

.range-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 65px;
    gap:12px;
    align-items:center;
}

.score-panel{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-direction:column;
    min-height:100%;
    background:#151C13;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
}

.score-ring{
    width:180px;
    height:180px;
    border-radius:50%;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle,#151C13 58%,transparent 59%),
        conic-gradient(var(--accent) 0deg,#485444 0deg);
    transition:.4s ease;
}

.score-ring strong{
    font-size:3rem;
}

.score-status{
    margin-top:15px;
    color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:900;
}

.score-explanation{
    max-width:420px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-top:8px;
}

/* =========================
   MATRIX
========================= */

.matrix{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:18px;
}

.matrix-item{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:22px;
}

.matrix-item h3{
    color:var(--accent);
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.matrix-item p{
    color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   SCENARIO SIMULATOR
========================= */

.simulator{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--surface);
}

.scenario-menu{
    background:#172016;
    border-right:1px solid var(--border);
}

.scenario-btn{
    width:100%;
    padding:18px;
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--text);
    border:0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    text-align:left;
}

.scenario-btn:hover,
.scenario-btn.active{
    background:var(--surface2);
    color:var(--accent);
}

.scenario-content{
    padding:35px;
}

.scenario-panel{
    display:none;
}

.scenario-panel.active{
    display:block;
}

.scenario-metric{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:12px;
    margin-top:25px;
}

.metric{
    background:#172016;
    padding:17px;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
}

.metric span{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.7rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.metric strong{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:1.25rem;
}

/* =========================
   AUDIT
========================= */

.audit{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;
    gap:25px;
}

.audit-list{
    display:grid;
    gap:10px;
}

.audit-item{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:flex-start;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:17px;
    border-radius:12px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.audit-item input{
    margin-top:6px;
    accent-color:var(--accent);
}

.audit-item.completed{
    border-color:var(--success);
    opacity:.75;
}

.audit-item.completed span{
    text-decoration:line-through;
}

.audit-score{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:25px;
    height:max-content;
    position:sticky;
    top:90px;
}

.audit-score-number{
    font-size:3rem;
    font-weight:900;
    color:var(--accent);
}

/* =========================
   STRATEGY BUILDER
========================= */

.builder{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:30px;
}

.builder-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:20px;
}

.builder-output{
    background:#121912;
    border:1px dashed var(--border);
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:22px;
    min-height:280px;
}

.output-label{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:.7rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.output-line{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:12px 0;
}

.output-line span{
    color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   PROGRESSION
========================= */

.progression{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    gap:10px;
}

.level{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--surface);
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:20px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.2s;
}

.level:hover,
.level.active{
    border-color:var(--accent);
    background:#293225;
}

.level-number{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:900;
}

.level h3{
    margin:8px 0;
    font-size:1rem;
}

.level p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.85rem;
}

.level-detail{
    margin-top:18px;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:22px;
    min-height:100px;
}

/* =========================
   XP ACTIONS
========================= */

.mission-board{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:15px;
}

.mission{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:var(--surface);
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:22px;
}

.mission.done{
    border-color:var(--success);
}

.mission h3{
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.mission p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.9rem;
}

.xp-tag{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:15px;
    color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:900;
}

/* =========================
   QUOTE
========================= */

.quote{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(216,180,226,.1),transparent),
        var(--surface);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:40px;
    font-size:1.35rem;
    line-height:1.5;
    text-align:center;
    font-weight:700;
}

.quote span{
    color:var(--accent);
}

/* =========================
   FOOTER
========================= */

footer{
    padding:80px 20px;
    text-align:center;
    background:#151C13;
}

footer h2{
    color:var(--accent);
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
}

footer p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:700px;
    margin:18px auto 0;
}

/* =========================
   TOAST
========================= */

#toast{
    position:fixed;
    right:20px;
    bottom:20px;
    background:var(--accent);
    color:#251D26;
    padding:13px 17px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:800;
    transform:translateY(100px);
    opacity:0;
    transition:.3s;
    z-index:9999;
}

#toast.show{
    transform:translateY(0);
    opacity:1;
}

/* =========================
   MOBILE
========================= */

@media(max-width:900px){

    .hero-grid,
    .lab-grid,
    .audit,
    .builder-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .insight-grid,
    .mission-board{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    }

    .progression{
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    }

    .simulator{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .scenario-menu{
        border-right:0;
        border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    }
}

@media(max-width:650px){

    .nav-inner{
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column;
    }

    .hero{
        padding-top:55px;
    }

    .hero h1{
        font-size:2.7rem;
    }

    .insight-grid,
    .matrix,
    .mission-board,
    .scenario-metric,
    .progression{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .section-head{
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column;
    }

    .lab,
    .builder{
        padding:20px;
    }

    .quote{
        padding:25px;
        font-size:1.1rem;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="scrollProgress"></div>

<!-- =========================
     NAVIGATION
========================= -->

<nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">

        <div class="brand">
            Location Strategy Lab
        </div>

        <div class="nav-actions">
            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('locationLab')">
                Location Lab
            </button>

            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('audit')">
                Audit
            </button>

            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('missions')">
                Missions
            </button>

            <button class="nav-btn" onclick="resetProgress()">
                Reset
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>
</nav>


<!-- =========================
     HERO
========================= -->

<header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-grid">

        <div>

            <div class="eyebrow">
                Strategic Mobility Intelligence
            </div>

            <h1>
                Location Is a
                <span>Variable.</span>
                Treat It Like One.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-copy">
                Location Power Differential Mapping transforms geography from
                a passive backdrop into a decision variable. Instead of asking
                only where you want to live or work, evaluate where your
                particular combination of capabilities, demand, competition,
                infrastructure, purchasing power, and networks produces the
                strongest strategic position.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">

                <button class="btn primary"
                        onclick="scrollToSection('locationLab')">
                    Run Location Analysis
                </button>

                <button class="btn"
                        onclick="scrollToSection('missions')">
                    Start Strategic Missions
                </button>

            </div>

        </div>


        <aside class="player-card">

            <div class="player-top">

                <div>
                    <div class="rank" id="rankName">
                        STRATEGIST I
                    </div>

                    <div class="xp-label">
                        Strategic XP
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="xp-number" id="xpNumber">
                    0
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="xp-track">
                <div class="xp-fill" id="xpFill"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-grid">

                <div class="stat">
                    <small>Location Score</small>
                    <strong id="heroScore">0</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <small>Audit</small>
                    <strong id="heroAudit">0%</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <small>Missions</small>
                    <strong id="heroMissions">0/6</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <small>Level</small>
                    <strong id="heroLevel">01</strong>
                </div>

            </div>

        </aside>

    </div>

</header>


<main class="container">


<!-- =========================
     CORE CONCEPT
========================= -->

<section>

    <div class="section-head">

        <div>
            <div class="section-number">01 / THE MODEL</div>
            <h2>Move From Geography to Strategy</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="section-intro">
            The central question is not whether one location is universally
            better than another. It is whether a particular environment
            improves the economics of your specific situation.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="quote">
        A location becomes strategically powerful when it improves the
        relationship between <span>what you can produce</span>,
        <span>who needs it</span>, and
        <span>what it costs to remain positioned there.</span>
    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     ADVANCED INSIGHTS
========================= -->

<section>

    <div class="section-head">

        <div>
            <div class="section-number">02 / ADVANCED INTELLIGENCE</div>
            <h2>The Hidden Variables</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="section-intro">
            Geographic advantage rarely comes from a single number.
            It emerges from interactions between variables that are usually
            evaluated separately.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="insight-grid">

        <article class="insight-card">

            <div class="number">01 — DEMAND</div>

            <h3>Demand-Skill Misalignment</h3>

            <p>
                A capability can appear ordinary in a large talent pool yet
                become unusually valuable when deployed against a shortage
                that employers or customers cannot easily resolve.
            </p>

            <div class="reveal">
                The useful metric is not simply “how many jobs exist.”
                Examine whether the problems being purchased are growing
                faster than the number of people capable of solving them.
            </div>

            <button class="reveal-btn"
                    onclick="toggleInsight(this)">
                Explore mechanism →
            </button>

        </article>


        <article class="insight-card">

            <div class="number">02 — FRICTION</div>

            <h3>Competition Is Only One Cost</h3>

            <p>
                Saturation affects more than visibility. It can increase
                customer acquisition effort, salary pressure, networking
                requirements, and the amount of proof required before trust
                is established.
            </p>

            <div class="reveal">
                A smaller market can therefore outperform a larger one if
                access costs, competitor density, and customer acquisition
                friction are substantially lower.
            </div>

            <button class="reveal-btn"
                    onclick="toggleInsight(this)">
                Explore mechanism →
            </button>

        </article>


        <article class="insight-card">

            <div class="number">03 — NETWORK</div>

            <h3>Proximity Changes Opportunity Flow</h3>

            <p>
                Certain ecosystems compress the distance between talent,
                capital, customers, institutions, mentors, vendors, and
                decision-makers.
            </p>

            <div class="reveal">
                Network density matters because opportunity often travels
                through repeated interactions. A strong position can reduce
                the number of steps required to reach the people who can
                accelerate your next move.
            </div>

            <button class="reveal-btn"
                    onclick="toggleInsight(this)">
                Explore mechanism →
            </button>

        </article>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     LOCATION LAB
========================= -->

<section id="locationLab">

    <div class="section-head">

        <div>
            <div class="section-number">03 / LOCATION LAB</div>
            <h2>Build a Location Differential Score</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="section-intro">
